# What GitHub counts as this repository's language.
#
# The ROS 2 packages under ros2_ws/src are the project; the scripts around
# them are scaffolding for producing and inspecting runs. Counted together,
# the scaffolding outweighs the C++ and Linguist calls the repository Python.
# These keep the language bar on the packages.
#
# The Python under ros2_ws/src is left counted: launch files and package
# tooling are part of those packages.

scenarios/**  linguist-vendored
tools/**      linguist-vendored
demo/**       linguist-vendored

# Run outputs, not source.
artifacts/**  linguist-generated
